'''Genesect''' (Japanese: '''ゲノセクト''' ''Genesect'') is a {{ct|Metal}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Crimson Blaze}} expansion.

