==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's rare print illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Vivid Voltage|Genesect|16}} from the {{TCG|Vivid Voltage}} expansion and the promo print illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Genesect|127}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion.
*'''Metal Blast''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Diamond & Pearl|Magnezone|8}} from {{TCG|Diamond & Pearl}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|X}}.

